{"path":"locale/ctype_char/~ctype","title":"std::ctype<char>::~ctype","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::ctype<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">&lt;char&gt;</span>::</span>~ctype","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/locale/ctype_char/~ctype","section":"locale","kind":"page","summary":"Destructs a std::ctype<char> facet. This destructor is protected and virtual (due to base class destructor being virtual).","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/locale\">&lt;locale&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">protected</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span> ~ctype<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Destructs a <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/ctype\"><span class=\"kw1955\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ctype</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> facet. This destructor is protected and virtual (due to <a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale/facet\">base class</a> destructor being virtual). An object of type <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/ctype\"><span class=\"kw1955\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ctype</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code>, like most facets, can only be destroyed when the last <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/locale\">std::locale</a></span> object that implements this facet goes out of scope or if a user-defined class is derived from <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/ctype\"><span class=\"kw1955\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ctype</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> and implements a public destructor.\n</p><p>If, when this instance of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/locale/ctype\"><span class=\"kw1955\">std::<span class=\"me2\">ctype</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span></span></code> was constructed, a custom classification table was provided and the second argument to the constructor (the boolean <code>del</code>) was <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw2\">true</span></span></code>, then this destructor executes <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">delete<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> table<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>","headings":[],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"locale","title":"Localization library"},{"path":"locale/ctype_char","title":"std::ctype<char>"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ctype<char>::~ctype","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration. Destructs a std::ctype<char> facet."}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":94,"codeBlockCount":0}
